  "title": "Invisible",
  "description": "An emotional father. An indifferent older brother. A mother who silently endures. Aya Kinomiya is a young girl growing up in a broken household. One day, she wishes *“I don’t want to be here…”* and suddenly, she gains the ability to become invisible. \n\nThis is the story of a girl’s journey to reclaim \"normality\" in her life—and to rediscover her pain. \n\n(Source: MANGA MILLION)\n\nStatus: completed\nTags: 21st century, Abusive Parents, Age Progression, Attempted Murder, Dead Parents, Drama, Family Life, Friendship, Girls Love Subtext, Glasses-Wearing Protagonist, Hallucinations, Introspection, Japan, Male Demographic with Female Lead, Music, Philosophy, Photography, Psychological, Quiet Female Lead, School, School Life, Shounen, Stalkers, Supernatural, Time Skip, Time Skip In First Chapter/Prologue, Working, Abuse, Abusive Father, Coming of Age, Domestic Abuse, Domestic Violence, Female Lead, Female Protagonist, Glasses-Wearing Female Lead, High School, Invisibility, Loneliness, Melancholy, Murder, Primarily Female Cast, Slice of Life, Special Ability, Dogs, Flashbacks, Older Brother",
